 <h3><u>Aise hum saqiye kausar ki taraf dekhte hai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya ali.. ya ali...Ya ali.. ya ali.....<br> Ya ali.. ya ali... ya ali.. ya aliii...</p> 
  <p>Aise hum saqiye kausar ki taraf dekhte hai..(3)<br> Jis tarha pyaase..(2) samandar ki taraf dekhte hai</p> 
  <p>1. Yaad aata hai hume 13 rajab ka manzar..(2)<br> Jab bhi Allah.. (2) tere ghar ki taraf dekhte hai</p> 
  <p>2. Khud samajh jaata hai malik ka ishara malik..(2)<br> bus ali malik e ashtar ki taraf dekhte hai</p> 
  <p>3. Ayatein ho ya Mohammad ho amaa'n ki khatir..(2)<br> Fatima zehra..(2) ki chadar ki taraf dekhte hai</p> 
  <p>4. Jab nuseri mere maula ko khuda kehta hai..(2)<br> has ke salmaan abuzar ki taraf dekhte hai</p> 
  <p>5. Hausla apna badhane ke liye mushkil mein..(2)<br> ambiya khud..(2) ali asghar ki taraf dekhte hai</p> 
  <p>6. Ruk jaa aye maut ziyarat ka maza lene de..(2)<br> hum abhi chehra e ..(2) Haider ki taraf dekhte hai</p> 
  <p>7. Lafz khud aale Mohammad ki sana mein akbar..(2)<br> jod kar hath sukhanwar ki taraf dekhte hai</p> 
  <p>Aise hum saqiye kausar ki taraf dekhte hai..(2)</p> 
